 an evolving web platform.\nWe looked at topics that were popular but contained some outdated or incomplete material, and invested time in improvements, additions, and removing obsolete content.\nThis post recaps what we","category":"Lập trình Web","topics":"","instructor":"vadim-makeev","platform":"MDN Web Docs","link":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/blog/mdn-2024-content-projects","origin":"crawl:mdn-blog","crawl_license":"CC BY-SA 2.5 (nội dung MDN; verify trước khi dùng thương mại)","crawl_lang":"en","crawl_hash":"1cb1e996be10584767bc242f20619157651b681fc89f1f72a18a004864762e83","source_updated_at":"2025-01-08T00:00:00Z","source_fetched_at":"2026-10-31T09:58:49Z"},{"item_id":5055,"title":"HTTP: Hypertext Transfer Protocol | MDN","type":"Tài liệu","level":"Trung cấp","description":"HTTP: Hypertext Transfer Protocol\nHTTP\nis an\napplication-layer\nprotocol for transmitting hypermedia documents, such as HTML.\nIt was designed for communication between web browsers and web servers, but it can also be used for other purposes, such as machine-to-machine communication, programmatic access to APIs, and more.\nHTTP follows a classical\nclient-server model\n, with a client opening a connection to make a request, then waiting until it receives a response from the server.\nHTTP is a\nstateless protocol\n, meaning that the server does not keep any session data between two requests, although t","category":"Lập trình","topics":"web,html,css,javascript,http","instructor":"Mozilla Contributors","platform":"Mozilla Contributors","link":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP","origin":"crawl:mdn-official","crawl_license":"CC-BY-SA-2.5-or-later; https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/MDN/Writing_guidelines/Attrib_copyright_license","crawl_lang":"en","crawl_hash":"c92ef480f2f244cf8bcd627c1697563882f767fb53fdebaa6529de85d503b421","source_updated_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:28:02Z"}],"generation_mode":"generating","provisional":true,"citation_valida